        "@value": "FYEAR - The Yardbird Suite"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "New composition from septet led by Kaie Kellough (winner of this year's Griffin Poetry Prize) and Jason Sharp (Constellation Records) recorded at Montreal's Lion d’Or venue. Live streaming on Thursday, April 29 at 6pm MST on the NAC website and FaceBook page, as well as on the Yardbird Suite's Facebook page. This show will air for 24 hours and is free of charge to the public."
      }
    ],
