        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Kris Davis - Solo piano - The Yardbird Suite"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Solo concert from Canadian pianist and composer, Kris Davis recorded at NYC’s internationally renowned jazz venue, The Jazz Gallery. Live streaming on Friday, April 30 at 6pm MST on the NAC website and partner FB pages, including the Yardbird Suite's Facebook page. This show will be available for 24 hours free of charge to the public."
      }
    ],
