      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The three Littlebirds Combos will be performing their year-end concerts on Sunday June 27th 2:00 p.m. at Big Miller Park outside the Yardbird Suite at 1312 109 St NW featuring the talents of 22 young musicians."
      }
