        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Dave Herrick Quintet: A Tribute to Freddie Hubbard - The Yardbird Suite"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Inarguably one of the great trumpeters of all time, Freddie Hubbard reimagined the sound of the jazz trumpet. His tone, attitude, technical prowess and phrasing is unmistakable and has influenced modern jazz trumpet players of today."
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#url": [
