      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "They don't make them as real as David Vest anymore. The son of an Alabama sharecropper, the Victoria BC resident is still going strong some 50 plus years since he first stepped on stage with the likes of Big Joe Turner."
      }
    ],
