      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The JAZZLAB ORCHESTRA, based in Montreal, defines itself as a specific group, a true institution in the Canadian jazz universe since 2004. The group explores music writing in many styles, supported each time by amazing composers and musicians."
      }
    ],
