        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "In the interest of exploring his connection with jazz as a person of Dene and Irish descent, this performance of Jay Gilday’s works will range from the exploratory folk music Jay is known for to the pure jazz he has always been inspired to play on piano and voice but has almost never chosen to make public."
