      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Mitchell Prentice is a Canadian Saxophonist born and raised in Calgary, Alberta, Canada. He is currently pursuing a Bachelor of Music degree in saxophone performance at MacEwan University under the tutelage of Jerrold Dubyk."
      }
