        "@value": "Parkland Music Project - The Yardbird Suite"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "\"Unmistakably sincere, with an emotional intensity reminiscent of Jason Molina” (Americana UK), Vancouver’s Parkland Music Project views alt-country roots through a kaleidoscope of textural improvisation, psych-rock energy, and thrillingly open-ended, uncommonly dynamic song structures."
      }
    ],
