        "@value": "Tuesday Jam Hosted by Renée Vinagreiro - The Yardbird Suite"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Renée Vinagreiro is a jazz saxophonist and composer currently based in-between Toronto and Edmonton. With influences from a wide array of genres, both traditional and contemporary, she brings a variety of music & sounds to the table. Influenced by artists such as Melissa Aldana, Seamus Blake, Joni Mitchell, and Michael Brecker; she showcases this through … Continued"
      }
    ],
