        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Vocalist and musical priestess Sierra Jamerson brings her fusion of jazz, neo-soul, and spiritual artistry to the Yardbird Suite for a special matinee performance, joined by stellar musicians from Funk the Matriarchy alongside other women and gender-diverse artists."
      }
    ],
