        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Inspired by the timeless swing of Stéphane Grappelli and Django Reinhardt, WCMA award-winning gypsy jazz ensemble Hot Club of Edmonton transports audiences to the romantic streets of 1930s and 40s France."
