        "@value": "Our live Tuesday Jam is hosted by a musician and a band while audience members join in on the fun by jamming along on stage. Musicians who want to participate in the Jam can purchase a “Jam Participant” ticket at a reduced cost. All Jam Participants need to register at the door upon entry to … Continued"
